                ["Pretty little thing, <v5>... Brought her over from Moonshade a while back. Might have been the return trip from takin' that fat sage Batlin across."];
                ["An' a sullen, bossy sort of fellow he was, too. Did not even have the decency ta lift a mug wit' me during the crossing! Bah! But what was I talkin' about... Ah yes, that lovely slip of a lass, Selina."];
                ["She must have been someone's servant. Said she wanted ta go home for a visit. Said she might be here for me ta take her back."];
