                }
                ["I'll try ta be kind." ~"So I'll merely say that Monitor's finest are no longer cut from the same sailcloth as Argus..." *"If what I've seen and heard is any judge, I'd say that the Pikemen are more interested in money than in valor... and me treasure."];
                TurnOff("Pikemen");
                TurnOn("treasure");
            }
            key ("treasure") {
                ["Aye, treasure... from me wilder, younger days."];
                ["Those Pikemen scoundrels tried ta convince me ta tell 'em where I keep me map. 'Tis lucky fer me that Argus would never let 'em search me room. I never keep it on me... Hide it in me room most times."];
                TurnOff("treasure");
            }
            key ("storms") {
                ["I've sailed the seas almost all the days of my life, <v5>." ~"And I'll tell ye that there's nothing on the water that I can't sail a ship through." *"But how can a man fight something that plucks a ship out o' the water, or turns a ship's sails into slabs of stone?" ~"And I'll not think me a coward ta tell ye that these storms have me plenty mindful of how deep them seas are!"];
                TurnOff("storms");
            }
            key ("journey") {
                TurnOff("journey");
                if (v0 = 1) {
                    ["I can take ye to Moonshade, <v5>." ~"Wait for me out on the Arabella, and we'll try to outrace these blasted storms!"];
                    Bark_i(10, "The Arabella sails in two minutes!", _Hawk);
                    v23 = ~NPCToItem_i(_Hawk);
                    SetNPCID_i(2, _Hawk);
                    v0 = 2;
                }
                terminate;
            }
            key ("leave island") {
                if $erstamgavejawbone {
                    ["So ye're still trying ta leave this island?"];
                    ["Well, I didn't want ta mention it before, but\x09there are caves in the southern mountains." ~"Legend says they lead ta the mainland, if thou canst find the right path..." ~"But none who ventured there have ever returned!" ~"I wager that Julia doth have possession of a key that would let thee in down there, but I would think twice if I were thee before I made such a journey!"];
                    $knowcatacombs = true;
                } else {
                    ["Not on my ship, thou won't!" ~"'Tis too dangerous ta sail these waters in these storms!" *"If thou dost want ta travel elsewhere, why not speak ta the mages?" ~"They know how ta magic themselves for short distances..." *"And I've heard it said that Old Erstam the Mad Mage can travel anywhere he pleases!"];
                }
                TurnOff("leave island");
            }
            key ("blue egg") {
                if ~IsInInv(3, 65177, _Gwani_Artifacts, 1, _Party) {
